> Retain both ranking quality and the fixed operating point

For autoencoder scores, white patches reach AUROC.999275 and TPR1; right shifts reach
AUROC.98615 and TPR.995. Darkening instead has AUROC.4028, AP.418652 and TPR.02, below the
AP.5 baseline for these equal pools. The mean-image residual has darkening AUROC0 and TPR0.
Ink deviation has darkening AUROC.94685 and TPR.72, but shift AUROC.486025 and TPR.05.
Nominal test FPR is.09/.07/.06 for AE/mean/ink, versus calibration.05 for all three. These
single-pool diagnostics have no significance or real-deployment performance claim.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/anomaly_auroc.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <map>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  std::map<std::string, n::Tensor> a;
  for (const auto& [k, v] : n::load_npz("build/anomaly/analysis.npz"))
    a.emplace(k, v);
  const std::vector<std::string> rules{"ae", "mean", "ink"}, names{"patch", "darkening", "shift"},
      labels{"AE residual", "Mean residual", "Ink deviation"};
  const std::vector<dm::graphics::RGB> colors{{37, 99, 235}, {220, 38, 38}, {22, 163, 74}};
  auto                                 plot = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
  for (int i = 0; i < 3; ++i) {
    const auto threshold = n::models::NominalThreshold(a.at("validation_" + rules[i] + "_score"));
    std::vector<double> values;
    for (const auto& name : names)
      values.push_back(
          n::models::RankAnomalies(
              a.at("test_" + rules[i] + "_score"),
              a.at(name + "_" + rules[i] + "_score"),
              threshold)
              .auroc);
    plot.points({0, 1, 2}, values, labels[i], colors[i], 5.);
  }
  plot.lines({-.3, 2.3}, {.5, .5}, "Chance AUROC", {100, 116, 139}, 1.);
  plot.x_limits(-.3, 2.3)
      .y_limits(-.03, 1.4)
      .x_ticks({0, 1, 2}, {"White patch", "Darkening", "Right shift"})
      .x_label("Every200-case paired stress pool")
      .y_label("AUROC")
      .title("A fixed corruption can reverse a residual ranking")
      .save_svg("build/anomaly_auroc.svg");
}
```
