> The blank input is a separate degenerate control

The blank's AE residual is.213015503541, above the nominal AE threshold.074898541875.
Its reconstruction is a learned decoder response, not a sampled pixel image. This one control
is not inserted into any normal/transformed ranking pool or used to tune the model/threshold.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/anomaly_blank.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
